Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.00,0:39:31.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh is I mean the the the key idea is still the thing I just told you.\N呃，我是说，核心思想还是我刚才告诉你的那个。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.99,0:39:36.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh this is just one thing that showed uh it's the robot became capable just\N呃，这只是其中一件事，你看，机器人突然就变得能干了。
