Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.92,0:43:14.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And um and the nice thing about human to robot transfer uh despite the fact that it's very costly to\N而且人机迁移的好处在于，尽管成本很高，但依然非常有价值
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.28,0:43:22.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,collect data and you still have to evaluate on robot is that we can finally agree on a data source data.\N收集数据后，我们仍需在机器人上进行评估，但至少现在我们可以就数据来源达成一致了。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.57,0:43:22.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.04,0:43:28.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have been in robotics for a while, the m major problem is everybody has different robot.\N如果你在机器人领域待了一段时间，就会发现最大的问题就是每个人的机器人都不一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.45,0:43:34.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,We all study different robots and despite the fact we're still having different robots,\N我们研究各种不同的机器人，尽管如此，我们仍然拥有各种不同的机器人。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.11,0:43:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,if we are studying the human to robot transfer problem, the human part we can all agree on.\N如果我们正在研究人机迁移问题，那么其中的人类部分，我们都可以达成共识。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.64,0:43:48.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we have a there's it's likely that we can have a common foundation for studying this problem and we have more consistent embodiment of robots and\N因此，我们很可能可以为研究这一问题建立一个共同的基础，并实现机器人具身形态的更高一致性。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.61,0:43:56.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,that that that allows us to to kind of pull maybe to to get together data to study this problem and uh but we still need a lot\N这让我们能够收集数据，来研究这个问题，但我们也还需要做很多工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.52,0:44:02.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,of data right we still need a lot of data to study this problem and I kind of did an estimate of what are the usable data\N数据方面，我们仍然需要大量数据来研究这个问题，我粗略估算了一下可用数据有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.48,0:44:09.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,open source data on on the internet for human data these days is roughly around 10k uh so there I know there's a lot startups like kind of\N如今互联网上的开源人类数据大约只有1万左右，我知道现在有很多初创公司都在做这方面。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.52,0:44:16.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,branding themselves as like oh I'm released a new data set if you look into them is that actually usable as super usable so I did an\N把自己包装成“哦，我发布了新的数据集”，但你仔细一看，这数据集真的能用吗？其实根本没法用，所以我做了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.55,0:44:27.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,estimate roughly around 10 hour usable data 10k hours of usable data but I theorized that maybe we need maybe 1 million to 10 million hours of uh\N大约需要10小时可用数据，1万小时可用数据，但我推测，也许我们需要100万到1000万小时的……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.45,0:44:37.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh human data to be able to to see more emerging behavior scale uh so so we really it requires a community effort to actually drive up the\N人类数据，以便观察到更多涌现行为的规模化，这确实需要社区共同努力才能真正推动。
