Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.70,0:44:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,make progress uh at least not that that's exists outside of these frontier labs.\N取得进展，至少这些前沿实验室之外并不存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.04,0:44:53.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh so this is why we decided to do a project called EgoVerse.\N所以我们就决定启动一个叫 EgoVerse 的项目。
